            </note>
            <note corresp="#d680-f2" n="33" xml:id="d680-f2-content">
                <p>The Special Commissioner and Mr. Briggs arrived in Monrovia on March 28.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d680-f3" n="34" xml:id="d680-f3-content">
